@@text Run 2026-11-01 (rcs234 / rcs234r, [scratch_run_2026-11-01.md](scratch_run_2026-11-01.md) 7): SQ-CS2-01, -04 to -08 PASS (-07 server half); -02 / -03 FAILED on 1.1.06 (`SwapRemapper` looked in Forge's staging registry), fixed in 1.1.07, PASS on rcs234r. The old CD had no items, only the two stick blocks and the processor type: the item parts of -01 / -03 do not apply.
@@text
@@text Two boots of one group A world. Boot 1 runs the OLD jars (`creative_delight-1.0.0.jar`, `creative_brewing-1.0.0.jar`,
@@text Creative Common 1.1.05, from `development/*/jar_archive/` or the current `mods/`) to make the save; boot 2 swaps in
